**The gate judges the mechanics.** Tend runs `{{gate_command}} --changed-files` on every contribution and merges none it refuses: the paths it changed, the build, the checks of the item table, of the markers' records and of the documents, and copying from the library's docstrings. Never approve a change you know the gate refused, and do not request changes on a count or a shape the gate checks. Your job is what no rule can see:

